    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "A reverb simulates the acoustic characteristics of a particular environment.",
      "ko": "리버브는 특정 환경의 음향 특성을 시뮬레이션합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7052879516aea6268792214409913be38bd7b86f45680d235daed40add4b6ed4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "Use the different presets to simulate a particular space and blend it in with the original signal using the [`wetDryMix`](avaudiounitreverb/wetdrymix.md) property.",
      "ko": "여러 프리셋을 사용하여 특정 공간을 시뮬레이션하고 [`wetDryMix`](avaudiounitreverb/wetdrymix.md) 속성으로 원본 신호와 혼합합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e369549b1dfb4ecb85e67980258ac778b2b8654735e3ff7e255984e6a6161ebf",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
